{"id":"661133","name":"牛奶小松饼","author":"伊悠悠","authorId":"230225","desc":"","cover":"images/661133/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"150g"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"3g"},{"name":"水","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"白砂糖","amount":"30g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"克水加酵母3克，白砂糖30克搅匀，打入2个鸡蛋。","img":"images/661133/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加面粉300克，在加150克牛奶，搅拌成流动状态。","img":"images/661133/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"发酵两倍大小，再次搅匀排气。","img":"images/661133/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入无油无水的电饼铛。","img":"images/661133/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"看见上面冒出很多小气孔。","img":"images/661133/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"翻面再煎。","img":"images/661133/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"反面煎成这样。","img":"images/661133/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"切块品尝。","img":"images/661133/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}